{
  "slug": "evolve-loop",
  "name": "Evolve Loop",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A self-learning development pipeline that gets smarter with every cycle. It calibrates itself against your codebase, dynamically selects the highest-impact tasks, implements them in isolated git worktrees, and blocks bad code through eval gates — then learns from each cycle to make better decisions next time.\n\n4 specialized agents (Scout, Builder, Auditor, Operator) work across 5 phases: DISCOVER → BUILD → AUDIT → SHIP → LEARN. The Scout uses multi-armed bandit\nscoring and 8-dimension quality benchmarks to target your codebase's weakest areas. The Builder implements in isolation. The Auditor blocks MEDIUM+ severity\nissues. After each cycle, the pipeline extracts reusable \"instincts\" — patterns about what worked and what failed — that compound over time.\n\nEvery 5 cycles, a meta-cycle evaluates the pipeline itself and evolves its own agent prompts based on measured performance. It ran 151 cycles on its own\ncodebase, shipping 67+ improvements and raising its quality score from 83.8 to 94.4 — all autonomously.\n\nNo external dependencies. MIT licensed.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **5 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `code-review-simplify` (Use when reviewing code changes for quality, security, performance, or maintainability issues and identifying simplification opportunities in a…), `evaluator` (Use when the user invokes /evaluator or asks to evaluate, assess, score, or independently audit code quality, project…), `evolve-loop` (Use when the user invokes /evolve-loop or asks to run autonomous improvement cycles, self-evolving development, compound discovery, or…), `inspirer` (Use when the user invokes /inspirer or asks to brainstorm creatively, think outside the box, explore unconventional approaches,…), `refactor` (Use when the user asks to refactor code, review code quality, or fix code smells — orchestrates the…)\n- **Agents** (5): `agent-templates` (Base schemas and context blocks for all agents), `evolve-auditor` (Single-pass review agent for the Evolve Loop), `evolve-builder` (Implementation agent for the Evolve Loop), `evolve-operator` (Post-cycle monitoring agent for the Evolve Loop), `evolve-scout` (Discovery and planning agent for the Evolve Loop)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install evolve-loop@claude-community` from `mickeyyaya/evolve-loop`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "agent": 5
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Dan Lee"
  },
